{"ticker":"EG","updated":"2026-10-30T22:46:18Z","profile":{"longName":"Everest Group, Ltd.","shortName":"Everest Group, Ltd.","sector":"Financial Services","industry":"Insurance - Reinsurance","country":"Bermuda","website":"https://www.everestglobal.com","fullTimeEmployees":3064,"marketCap":15370277888,"trailingPE":8.635637,"forwardPE":6.7684436,"priceToSalesTrailing12Months":0.9481973,"pegRatio":0.97,"targetMeanPrice":413.6875,"targetHighPrice":530.0,"targetLowPrice":368.0,"numberOfAnalystOpinions":16,"recommendationKey":"buy","revenueGrowth":-0.146,"earningsGrowth":0.005,"grossMargins":0.15811,"operatingMargins":0.081870005,"profitMargins":0.11666001,"totalRevenue":16209999872,"beta":null,"fiftyTwoWeekHigh":413.0,"fiftyTwoWeekLow":304.55,"currency":"USD","exchange":"NYQ","quoteType":"EQUITY","dividendYield":2.0},"summary":"Everest Group, Ltd., together with subsidiaries, provides reinsurance and insurance products in the United States, Europe, and internationally. It operates in two segment, Insurance and Reinsurance. The company writes property and casualty reinsurance; treaty and facultative reinsurance products; and specialty lines of business through reinsurance brokers, as well as directly with ceding companies; and writes property and casualty insurance directly, as well as through brokers, surplus lines, and general agents. It provides reinsurance products comprising mortgage, catastrophe, marine, aviation, engineering, professional line, credit and surety, motor, agriculture/crop, and political violence reinsurance products. In addition, the company offers commercial property and casualty insurance products through wholesale and retail brokers, surplus lines brokers, and program administrators. The company was formerly known as Everest Re Group, Ltd. and changed its name to Everest Group, Ltd. in July 2023.Everest Group, Ltd., was founded in 1973 and is headquartered in Hamilton, Bermuda.","summary_zh":"Everest Group, Ltd. 及其子公司在美國、歐洲和國際上提供再保險和保險產品。它分為保險和再保險兩個部門。該公司承保財產和傷亡再保險；條約和臨時再保險產品；透過再保險經紀人以及直接與分保公司開展專業業務；直接承保財產和意外傷害保險，也可以透過經紀人、盈餘保險公司和總代理承保。它提供的再保險產品包括抵押貸款、巨災、海事、航空、工程、專業保險、信貸和擔保、汽車、農業/農作物和政治暴力再保險產品。此外，該公司還透過批發和零售經紀人、盈餘保險經紀人和計劃管理員提供商業財產和傷亡保險產品。該公司前身為Everest Re Group, Ltd.，於2023年7月更名為Everest Group, Ltd.。 Everest Group, Ltd.成立於1973年，總部位於百慕達漢密爾頓。","sector_zh":"金融服務","industry_zh":"保險 - 再保險","candles":[{"t":"2025-09-02","o":341.52,"h":346.0,"l":339.93,"c":345.35,"v":445400},{"t":"2025-09-03","o":342.0,"h":349.74,"l":341.1,"c":348.53,"v":507900},{"t":"2025-09-04","o":350.0,"h":351.76,"l":344.93,"c":345.26,"v":341600},{"t":"2025-09-05","o":343.6,"h":345.27,"l":339.39,"c":340.0,"v":195400},{"t":"2025-09-08","o":338.79,"h":340.3,"l":334.65,"c":339.58,"v":298600},{"t":"2025-09-09","o":339.76,"h":341.82,"l":338.85,"c":340.61,"v":332400},{"t":"2025-09-10","o":338.94,"h":341.3,"l":335.9,"c":340.03,"v":274000},{"t":"2025-09-11","o":340.93,"h":349.15,"l":338.5,"c":348.44,"v":320400},{"t":"2025-09-12","o":349.51,"h":352.45,"l":347.66,"c":349.37,"v":487600},{"t":"2025-09-15","o":348.5,"h":353.47,"l":339.61,"c":339.84,"v":317700},{"t":"2025-09-16","o":334.77,"h":336.86,"l":327.35,"c":330.63,"v":386400},{"t":"2025-09-17","o":331.28,"h":338.77,"l":330.0,"c":333.65,"v":397000},{"t":"2025-09-18","o":333.03,"h":336.15,"l":332.5,"c":334.75,"v":332200},{"t":"2025-09-19","o":335.76,"h":337.01,"l":332.27,"c":335.38,"v":1062700},{"t":"2025-09-22","o":333.0,"h":336.08,"l":332.65,"c":334.83,"v":295500},{"t":"2025-09-23","o":336.72,"h":340.32,"l":334.68,"c":337.93,"v":302300},{"t":"2025-09-24","o":337.87,"h":346.72,"l":333.89,"c":345.54,"v":428200},{"t":"2025-09-25","o":344.7,"h":349.15,"l":341.95,"c":345.21,"v":409900},{"t":"2025-09-26","o":347.56,"h":351.95,"l":343.97,"c":349.11,"v":359900},{"t":"2025-09-29","o":348.86,"h":348.86,"l":343.29,"c":345.49,"v":346800},{"t":"2025-09-30","o":345.73,"h":350.95,"l":344.5,"c":350.23,"v":234300},{"t":"2025-10-01","o":351.35,"h":356.29,"l":348.3,"c":353.53,"v":230900},{"t":"2025-10-02","o":350.06,"h":3